Self-contained 36KB CoD-inspired top-down tactical arena shooter (\`index.html\`, zero dependencies, canvas + procedural WebAudio). WASD/sprint, mouse aim, hold-LMB fire with recoil, hold-RMB ADS, R reload, CoD-style health regen. Melee Rushers + strafing Troopers across 3 waves, then reach the green extraction zone to win; HP 0 = lose. Stats + redeploy on both end screens. Edge-only HUD (objective/wave bar, minimap, kill feed, health/stamina, ammo, kills/timer, hitmarkers, off-screen chevrons, extraction compass).

