### Deployment & test status
- Public URL returns HTTP 200 and serves the game (title + game globals confirmed in-page).
- Local port-3000 server (\`app-server\` tmux) also verified serving the identical page.
- Headless-Chromium playtests against **both** deployments, all with zero console/page errors: real-input fire/ADS/reload-to-full, pause/resume, live kills, wave 1→2→3→extraction progression, extraction→WIN, restart, death→LOSE, restart again. Fixed along the way: a shell-casing crash that froze rendering, player spawning inside a crate, and ADS aim math.

### Known limitations
- Desktop keyboard+mouse only; no touch controls.
- Bot playtests show wave 3 is hot for a stationary player — movement, cover, and regen matter; difficulty is tuned for active play, not idle survival.
